repository-code: "https://github.com/<group17>/ltis-london-transit-immune-system"
url: "https://<group17>.github.io/ltis-london-transit-immune-system/"
abstract: >
  LTRS is a resilience-aware urban mobility visualisation built for the
  CASA0029 Urban Data Visualisation module. It treats Tube line disruption as
  a stress test on London's transport network, and visualises retained
  mobility, accessibility loss, population exposure and line dependency at
  LSOA scale. The project combines an interactive web frontend (React +
  MapLibre + D3 + Visx) with a reproducible Python data pipeline (PTAL,
  NaPTAN, ONS LSOA population, IMD).
